auth {
  mode: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Requests inherit {{token}}: whoever logged in last. Each login in the Auth
  folder also keeps its own token (ownerToken, frodoToken, ...) for requests
  that must act as a particular user. Running the whole Auth folder logs in
  The Orc Shack owner last, so the other folders run as the owner.
  Demo users and their password come from `pony seed`.
}
